# Terraform local cache/state/plans
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Local Terraform variables may contain network/account information
**/terraform.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars.json

# Kubernetes Secret with live credentials
eks/global-files/secrets-togglemaster.yaml
**/secrets-togglemaster.yaml

# Local/temporary generated files
*.log
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Reused by destroy to supply the required Terraform variable
.togglemaster-admin-cidr
